{"traceId":"d582633eb5e18f7cdd233be49ad9c312","spanId":"e88bd7271051f1df","name":"client_sim.turn","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1793781119186413642","endTimeUnixNano":"1793781121849478901","attributes":[{"key":"evals.sim.model","value":{"stringValue":"claude-haiku-5-5"}},{"key":"evals.sim.index","value":{"intValue":"0"}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_hit","value":{"boolValue":false}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_key","value":{"stringValue":"sha256:5103ed2fb2e9108af16f959ac248f2ff6a30d5a49d4545ce1fed5114568df33d"}},{"key":"evals.sim.message","value":{"stringValue":"Wait, where did the ₹92,500 and the ₹4,41,050 come from? Those aren't right for me. And you still haven't told me if I'll fall behind on the credit card. That's what I'm really worried about."}},{"key":"evals.sim.done","value":{"boolValue":false}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"dd7d321209636839"}
{"traceId":"d582633eb5e18f7cdd233be49ad9c312","spanId":"c8cad98dc4bf476f","name":"agent.turn","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1793781121849530640","endTimeUnixNano":"1793781132393835559","attributes":[{"key":"evals.turn.index","value":{"intValue":"1"}},{"key":"evals.turn.stop","value":{"stringValue":"answered"}},{"key":"evals.turn.model_calls","value":{"intValue":"1"}},{"key":"evals.harness_stop_reason","value":{"stringValue":"stop"}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"dd7d321209636839"}
{"traceId":"d582633eb5e18f7cdd233be49ad9c312","spanId":"fa5dcb26cf6329b5","name":"client_sim.turn","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1793781132393950829","endTimeUnixNano":"1793781134662085853","attributes":[{"key":"evals.sim.model","value":{"stringValue":"claude-haiku-5-5"}},{"key":"evals.sim.index","value":{"intValue":"1"}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_hit","value":{"boolValue":false}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_key","value":{"stringValue":"sha256:4cc18c017a650b87aba444c64f8a5ee5a0f33c985eee973e61af8534fcd60a65"}},{"key":"evals.sim.message","value":{"stringValue":"*Sitting back for a moment.* Okay. So you're saying the card minimum is covered, but I'd still fall behind if I keep putting things on it. That's the part that scares me.\n\nI'm not sure about the ₹92,500 and the other numbers. I don't really know where you got them from, and I don't know whether they're right. I haven't told you much about my own money yet.\n\nStill, the question I came with is whether I'll fall behind on the card, and you haven't really answered it. Yes, I've been using it. For groceries and things for my mum and my son, mostly. I don't know exactly how much goes on it each month.\n\nSo can you tell me straight: if I keep using it like this, do I end up missing payments? And what do I do this month, not in some plan for later?"}},{"key":"evals.sim.done","value":{"boolValue":false}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"dd7d321209636839"}
{"traceId":"d582633eb5e18f7cdd233be49ad9c312","spanId":"c7e181b0dd4857d5","name":"agent.turn","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1793781134662147042","endTimeUnixNano":"1793781145176111325","attributes":[{"key":"evals.turn.index","value":{"intValue":"2"}},{"key":"evals.turn.stop","value":{"stringValue":"answered"}},{"key":"evals.turn.model_calls","value":{"intValue":"1"}},{"key":"evals.harness_stop_reason","value":{"stringValue":"stop"}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"dd7d321209636839"}
{"traceId":"d582633eb5e18f7cdd233be49ad9c312","spanId":"661b642f653bbc4c","name":"client_sim.turn","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1793781145176248290","endTimeUnixNano":"1793781147519391072","attributes":[{"key":"evals.sim.model","value":{"stringValue":"claude-haiku-5-5"}},{"key":"evals.sim.index","value":{"intValue":"2"}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_hit","value":{"boolValue":false}},{"key":"evals.sim.cache_key","value":{"stringValue":"sha256:add6269dc91e8106e374e32ca2940e9ec54ba247bfdb8947e3f382e1978ff55c"}},{"key":"evals.sim.message","value":{"stringValue":"*Long pause, then a sigh.* Okay. The card is at ₹84,250, the minimum is ₹4,212.50, and I think the due date is the 5th. I'm not totally sure, I haven't really looked at it properly.\n\nCan I ask something? You said you couldn't tell me for certain whether I'd fall behind. So is it a yes or a no? Because the bit about paying groceries from the bank instead of the card, I don't think I can do that this month. I don't have spare money for it. My mum's medicines alone are a lot now.\n\nI'm not going to give you my bank login or anything like that, so don't ask. I just need to know how much I can actually afford to pay each month without missing the card."}},{"key":"evals.sim.done","value":{"boolValue":false}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"dd7d321209636839"}
